          "caption": "Tourin Quay This is unmarked on the OS map but apparently was of great economic importance right up to the 1940s. Trading vessels would sail up the Blackwater to Tourin Quay and other places en-route, carrying cargoes of coal from Youghal, and returning with iron ore, linen and other produce for trans-shipment.",
